    ["C_Traits.GetTraitDescription(130425, 1)"] = "1: string Gives the Paladin a chance to deal additional Holy damage equal to 70% of normal weapon damage.  Only one Seal can be active on the Paladin at any one time.  Lasts 30 sec.\r\n\r\nUnleashing this Seal's energy will judge an enemy, instantly causing 46 to 51 Holy damage, 93 to 101 if the target is stunned or incapacitated.",
